  m_text: 'The state of Meghalaya is well known for various crafts. Handicrafts made
    with cane and bamboo products, textile weaving, carpet weaving, ornament making
    and woodcarving also hold important place in Meghalaya''s art and crafts. In
    fact, weaving forms an integral part in the culture of the state and its tribes.
    Wood carving of Meghalaya is an ancient art that flourished in the rural parts
    of Meghalaya, especially around the Garo hills. '
